== ADR-0009: an index is not a chain target. In `V[I] := I := 4` the element
== would depend on whether V[I] is located before or after I changes; Inox does
== not pick one silently.
Module Diagnostics.ChainedAssignmentIndexTarget

Main :
    I := 1
    V[I] := I := 4
;
